
                   Simple Strip! (C) 1994 Hydra/Tension!


Oh Kewl!  Another stripper program you're thinking (NOT!)

Well, this one's different!  it's SIMPLE! :-)  (Hence the name!)

all this program does is take one text file and remove certain lines from in
and writing the output to another file,  the lines it removes are specified
in another text file (you may have upto 1000 lines), each line being on a
seperate line,  be careful that you don't have a blank line anywhere in the
file tho :-)


Anywayz, that's it really!  Nothing special but it's still usefull to me!

I personally use it for removing the line that says

"UNREGISTERED, PLEASE REGISTER THIS PROGRAM"

from the output file of a certain bulletin maker! :-) Giggle!




Right ?  Think you could do better than this ?  Well, Do it then!   This aint
meant to be the be all off strippers, but it's nice'n'handy!

If you have any other cool ideas for programs that you want me to write then
